```makefile
model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained('gpt2')
```
Once the model has been loaded, you can use its `forward` method to generate predictions for new input sequences. The `forward` method takes a sequence of input tokens as its argument, and returns a tensor of shape `(sequence_length, vocab_size)` representing the predicted probabilities for each possible next token.

