        AdditiveAttention(
            W=None,  # None creates a trainable projection
            ceilWeightMatrixLayerSize=additiveAttentionCeilingLayerSize,
            randomWeightMatrixSizes=additiveAttentionRandomMtxSizes,
            normalizeW=True,
            activationThreshold=0.0
        )
    )


The Dot attention implementation is shown below as a separate listing which includes
the optional logit scaling factor.

.. highlight:: python

.. code-block:: python

    dotAttentionLayer = AlphaDropout(noise_shape=(None, 1))(
        DotAttention(logitsScalingFactor=dotAttentionLogitsScalingFactor)
