    "output_dir": "output",
    "source_schema": "None" | "source",
    "stats_dir": "stats",
    "top_level_filter": "number_of_nodes",
    "top_level_metric": "weakly_connected_nodes"
}
```
`config.json` is used by the neo4jcd command to customize neo4jcd (a tool for importing COGs data to Neo4j) parameters. The structure of the file is shown below:
```
{
